OL,3,AChrysler Building to get its crown
OL,4,Arestored after being sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chrysler Building, one of the most
OL,7,Fdistinctive high-rises in Manhattan's
OL,8,Fskyline, will undergo a major
OL,9,Frenovation as part of a
OL,10,Fmulti-million-dollar sale deal.
OL,12,FThe skyscraper, opened in New York
OL,13,Fnearly 100 years ago, will see its Art
OL,14,FDeco crown polished and restored during
OL,15,Fa refurbishment that will also involve
OL,16,Fthe restoration of the building's
OL,17,F77-storey facade.
OL,19,FDeveloper Tishman Speyer has taken over
OL,20,Fthe lease from the Cooper Union for the
OL,21,FAdvancement of Science and Art, a
OL,22,Fprivate college.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
