OL,3,AChrysler Building to get its crown
OL,4,Arestored after being sold
OL,5,
OL,6,FTishman Speyer and its partners will
OL,7,Finvest $235m (#178m) in the project, as
OL,8,Fpart of which it will upgrade the 61st
OL,9,Ffloor, which is home to huge eagle
OL,10,Fgargoyles and will also feature an
OL,11,F"upscale" lounge.
